        "Small pouch for pebbles" to "Kankariyon ke liye chhoti thaili",
        "Personal medicines and prescriptions" to "Apni dawaiyan aur nuskhe",
        "Umbrella, water bottle and power bank" to "Chhatri, paani ki botal aur power bank",
        "Ziyarat of Madinah" to "Madinah ki Ziyarat", "Presenting salam to the Prophet ﷺ" to "Nabi ﷺ ki bargah mein salaam",
        "Presenting yourself at the blessed Rauda of the Prophet ﷺ is among the greatest blessings of the journey. Go with adab, lower your voice and send abundant durood." to "Nabi ﷺ ke Roza-e-Mubarak par haazri is safar ki sab se badi sa'adaton mein se hai. Adab ke saath jayein, awaaz pust rakhein aur kasrat se durood padhein.",
        "Masjid an-Nabawi" to "Masjid-e-Nabawi", "Riyad al-Jannah" to "Riyaz-ul-Jannah", "Masjid Quba" to "Masjid-e-Quba",
        "Jannat al-Baqi and Uhud" to "Jannat-ul-Baqi aur Uhud",
